@base = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@email = student@example.com
@password = homework-password
@ad_id = 1

### Register once; repeated email returns 409
POST {{base}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}"}

### Public list
GET {{base}}/advertisements

### Create as the logged-in user (201); copy its id into ad_id above
POST {{base}}/advertisements
Authorization: Basic {{email}} {{password}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Desk for sale", "description": "Good condition"}

### Public detail
GET {{base}}/advertisements/{{ad_id}}

### Update as the owner
PATCH {{base}}/advertisements/{{ad_id}}
Authorization: Basic {{email}} {{password}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Desk: new price"}

### Delete as the owner (204)
DELETE {{base}}/advertisements/{{ad_id}}
Authorization: Basic {{email}} {{password}}

### Unauthenticated creation must fail (401)
POST {{base}}/advertisements
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Desk", "description": "Good condition"}
